</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.334" end="00:25.021"><span begin="00:24.334" end="00:24.646">Fashion </span><span begin="00:24.646" end="00:25.021">tardis</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.021" end="00:26.459"><span begin="00:25.021" end="00:25.334">Down </span><span begin="00:25.334" end="00:25.709">at </span><span begin="00:25.709" end="00:26.084">Quo </span><span begin="00:26.084" end="00:26.459">Vadis</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.459" end="00:27.646"><span begin="00:26.459" end="00:26.771">Who </span><span begin="00:26.771" end="00:27.146">laughs </span><span begin="00:27.146" end="00:27.459">the </span><span begin="00:27.459" end="00:27.646">longest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.646" end="00:28.897"><span begin="00:27.646" end="00:27.834">Who </span><span begin="00:27.834" end="00:28.146">drives </span><span begin="00:28.146" end="00:28.521">the </span><span begin="00:28.521" end="00:28.897">hardest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.897" end="00:30.021"><span begin="00:28.897" end="00:29.271">Pleasure </span><span begin="00:29.271" end="00:29.584">and </span><span begin="00:29.584" end="00:30.021">leisure</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.021" end="00:34.117"><span begin="00:30.021" end="00:30.271">Make </span><span begin="00:30.271" end="00:30.584">mine </span><span begin="00:30.584" end="00:31.021">a </span><span begin="00:31.021" end="00:31.396">double </span><span begin="00:31.396" end="00:31.709">measure </span><span begin="00:31.709" end="00:32.021">with </span><span begin="00:32.021" end="00:34.117">friends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.554" end="00:38.492"><span begin="00:35.554" end="00:36.054">Just </span><span begin="00:36.054" end="00:36.304">because </span><span begin="00:36.304" end="00:36.492">I </span><span begin="00:36.492" end="00:36.804">ain't </span><span begin="00:36.804" end="00:37.117">double </span><span begin="00:37.117" end="00:38.492">barrelled</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin