" begin="01:20.146" end="01:21.333"><span begin="01:20.146" end="01:20.396">She's </span><span begin="01:20.396" end="01:20.646">looking </span><span begin="01:20.646" end="01:20.896">real </span><span begin="01:20.896" end="01:21.333">drab</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.333" end="01:22.458"><span begin="01:21.333" end="01:21.584">Just </span><span begin="01:21.584" end="01:21.896">out </span><span begin="01:21.896" end="01:22.146">of </span><span begin="01:22.146" end="01:22.458">rehab</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.458" end="01:23.396"><span begin="01:22.458" end="01:22.771">I'm </span><span begin="01:22.771" end="01:23.021">talking </span><span begin="01:23.021" end="01:23.396">football</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.396" end="01:25.521"><span begin="01:23.396" end="01:24.084">She's </span><span begin="01:24.084" end="01:24.396">talking </span><span begin="01:24.396" end="01:24.771">ab </span><span begin="01:24.771" end="01:25.521">fab</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.521" end="01:27.396"><span begin="01:25.521" end="01:25.896">Your </span><span begin="01:25.896" end="01:26.209">clothes </span><span begin="01:26.209" end="01:26.896">are </span><span begin="01:26.896" end="01:27.209">very </span><span begin="01:27.209" end="01:27.396">kitch</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.396" end="01:31.146"><span begin="01:27.396" end="01:27.646">Just </span><span begin="01:27.646" end="01:27.834">because </span><span begin="01:27.834" end="01:28.021">your </span><span begin="01:28.021" end="01:28.271">daddy </span><span begin="01:28.271" end="01:28.709">is </span><span begin="01:28.709" end="01:31.146">rich</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.146" end="01:33.834"><span begin="01:31.146" end="01:31.459">You </span><span begin="01:31.459" end="01:31.834">sound </span><span begin="01:31.834" end="01:32.146">so </span><span begin="01:32.146" end="01:32.334">funny </span><span begin="01:32.334" end="01:32.521">with </span><span beg